_entity_src_nat.details                    
;SYNTHETIC HETEROBIVALENT TACRINE-BASED DIMER, A8B (N-4'-QUINOLYL-N'-9"-(1", 2", 3", 4" -TETRAHYDROACRIDINYL)-1, 8-DIAMINOOCTANE) DIHYDROCHLORIDE WITH THE TACRINE MOIETY BOUND TO THE 'ANIONIC' SUBSITE, NEAR THE BOTTOM OF THE ACTIVE SITE GORGE, AND THE 4-AMINOQUINOLINE MOIETY BOUND TO THE 'PERIPHERAL' ANIONIC SITE (PAS) AT THE TOP OF THE GORGE OF TCACHE, BOTH IN A DOUBLE-STACKING SANDWICH. THE LIGAND, A8B, THUS BINDS BY SPANNING THE ACTIVE-SITE GORGE.
;
